Description: Xiaomi Pad 6 support meta package for Ubuntu
 Pulls in the full device support stack for running Ubuntu on the
 Xiaomi Pad 6 (pipa): custom kernel, firmware, sensors, audio, camera,
 and boot configuration. Also installs the pipa-pkgs apt source.
